{"id":"1431100578","kind":"answer","title":"有没有基于安卓系统的艾宾浩斯复习软件？","author":"Thoughts Memo","original_authors":["Thoughts Memo"],"original_source_urls":[],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"间隔重复的历史","date":"2020-08-24","updated":"2020-08-24","votes":9,"comment_count":0,"minutes":1,"chars":427,"keywords":["间隔重复","SuperMemo","学习史","记忆研究","知识传播"],"summary":"先捉个 bug，没有所谓的艾宾浩斯复习软件，真正的名称是间隔重复软件 SRS(Spaced Repetition Software) [1] [2] 。 然后是正题，有没有基于安卓系统间隔重复软件？ 当然有，AnkiDroid 就是一个开源的 SRS + FlashCard 的软件，和 PC 端的 Anki，iOS 端的 An…","question_detail_html":"<p>之前使用ios系统的时候遇到了一款特别喜欢的复习软件，叫做年轮，可以自定义复习计划，有文本挖空，图片翻盖，等等一系列的复习手段，最近换到了安卓系统不知道有没有类似的复习软件</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-a6ee0f2cf68a916b7293bffb5a8534bf_r.jpg\" width=\"1080\"/></figure><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-82ff2708386043165eb3abf4153579c1_r.jpg\" width=\"1080\"/></figure><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-84933ef8732bda8c6034ef18622a7b8f_r.jpg\" width=\"1080\"/></figure><p></p>","zhihu_url":"https://www.zhihu.com/question/405343299/answer/1431100578","restoration":null,"toc":[],"html":"<p data-pid=\"zryInBWH\">先捉个 bug，没有所谓的艾宾浩斯复习软件，真正的名称是间隔重复软件 SRS(Spaced Repetition Software)<sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup>。</p><p data-pid=\"iJCxx47W\">然后是正题，有没有基于安卓系统间隔重复软件？</p><p data-pid=\"S8Fhd5Xy\">当然有，AnkiDroid 就是一个开源的 SRS + FlashCard 的软件，和 PC 端的 Anki，iOS 端的 Ankimobile 可以多平台同步。</p><p data-pid=\"H9MyBbY_\">具体介绍我就不说了，看这篇文章就知道了：</p><a class=\"internal\" data-image=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-a6b3a126d1ef5becd4b0bfae0ece0e19_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"298\" data-image-width=\"836\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/35039475\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">叶峻峣：简单了解「Anki」是什么</a><p data-pid=\"WUhmvvkr\">教程则是这篇：</p><a class=\"internal\" data-image=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-acfa8f607f2d3c74ba5c660c3ab25df0_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"500\" data-image-width=\"1161\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/61564332\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">叶峻峣：Anki 教程(电子书)与 B 站 Ankidroid 教程(视频)快速通道</a><p data-pid=\"TDr1vXJD\">希望对大家有所帮助。</p><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spaced_repetition <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spaced_repetition\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spaced_repetition</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-2\">↩</a> https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/92640205 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"92640205\" href=\"#/post/92640205\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"92640205","title":"01 前言","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":27,"minutes":4,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"473666349","title":"15 间隔重复的指数式普及","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":18,"minutes":10,"reason":"延伸深读 · Piotr Wozniak"},{"id":"97887756","title":"04 1987 SuperMemo 1.0: 日志","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":33,"minutes":14,"reason":"延伸深读 · Piotr Wozniak"},{"id":"207094393","title":"06 1989: SuperMemo 适应用户记忆(中)","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":18,"minutes":13,"reason":"延伸深读 · Piotr Wozniak"},{"id":"205600711","title":"06 1989: SuperMemo 适应用户记忆(上)","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":17,"minutes":8,"reason":"延伸深读 · Piotr Wozniak"},{"id":"456690402","title":"12 1999：命名为「间隔重复」","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":10,"minutes":5,"reason":"延伸深读 · Piotr Wozniak"}],"rec_ans